      "Five paired fixtures make this a descriptive screen, without confidence intervals or a reliable policy ranking.",
      "One factor changes per test. Two settings do not describe every intermediate value or interaction.",
      "Influence measures change, not improvement; scores depend on tested ranges and equal metric weights and are not comparable across scenarios.",
      "Unstarted requests contribute waiting time up to day 365; this is not an eventual observed start time.",
      "The same analytical 14-day start target is applied to all scenarios; it does not impose an IST deadline.",
      "Full training completion, first start and completed documentation are distinct outcomes.",
      "Costs value consumed work and the LMS portfolio, not observed cash savings or equal-output savings.",
      "The separate LMS team frees one modelled P&Q teaching calendar and makes courses available at day 0; setup and upkeep remain costed.",
      "Demand-volume settings can change annual case counts and completion denominators; topic mix changes practice demand without changing the case count."
